{"title": "Find Familiar", "pageid": 1389, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Find_Familiar", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Ritual spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_summoned_familiars\" title=\"List of summoned familiars\">List of summoned familiars</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Cat.webp, /w/images/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Find_Familiar_Cat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Find Familiar </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 conjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to conjure a fey familiar that can aid them in combat and world exploration.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a familiar, a fey spirit that takes an animal form of your choosing<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_FindFamiliar_Ritual</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_FindFamiliar_Ritual\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_FindFamiliar_Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Beast_Tamer\" title=\"Beast Tamer\">Beast Tamer</a>)</li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\">Pact of the Chain</a>)</li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/38px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/50px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\">Ritual Caster: Free Spells</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although listed as a <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ritual spell\">Ritual spell</a> where one might expect otherwise, this spell - as per its description - has the limitation of being cast only once per short rest, per character. The standard (non-racial) version of the cantrip <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand\" title=\"Mage Hand\">Mage Hand</a> has the same limitation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\">Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit</a> and the version of Find Familiar granted from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster\" title=\"Ritual Caster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/38px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/50px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Caster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ritual Caster\">Ritual Caster</a> feat have separate once per short rest limitations. A character who knows multiple versions of these spells can summon familiars multiple times (once for each version known) without short resting, though they are still limited to one active familiar at a time.</li>\n<li>Familiars are automatically dismissed when the caster leaves the active party.</li>\n<li>When cast by a Wizard, a conjured familiar persists if the caster unprepares the spell and unlike most summons, persists even after a long rest.</li>\n<li>All versions and variants of the Find Familiar spell are mutually exclusive; a character can only have one familiar summoned by any Find Familiar spell at a time, including special summons like <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\">Shovel</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\">Scratch</a>, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raven_Gloves\" title=\"Raven Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raven_Gloves\" title=\"Raven Gloves\">Raven Gloves</a> spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Summon_Quothe_the_Raven\" title=\"Summon Quothe the Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Summon Quothe the Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Summon_Quothe_the_Raven\" title=\"Summon Quothe the Raven\">Summon Quothe the Raven</a>, and the additional options granted to a <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Chain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\">Pact of the Chain</a>. However, this does <i>not</i> include <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Us\" title=\"Conjure Us\">Us</a>, as it does not count as a Find Familiar variant. Casting another version of the spell dismisses any currently summoned familiar.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Beast_Master\" title=\"Beast Master\">Beast Master</a> Ranger feature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Summon_Companion\" title=\"Summon Companion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/20px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/30px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/40px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Summon Companion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/20px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Summon_Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Summon Companion\">Summon Companion</a> is separate to Find Familiar, and may also be active at the same time.</li>\n<li>Familiars can drink elixirs and potions by having someone else place elixirs/potions out of their inventory and then have the familiar drink it from the ground by right-clicking them, or by drinking it directly from a companion's inventory as long as the elixir/potion is not inside a container.</li>\n<li>Even though familiars can drink elixirs, increasing their <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> serves no purpose outside of increasing jump distance, as their attacks <i>always</i> use <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>.</li>\n<li>The raven is the only standard familiar given a specific name: \"Quothe\". This is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">reference</a> to Edgar Allen Poe's poem \"The Raven\", and probably also the raven Quoth who appears in Terry Pratchett's Discworld novels (himself a reference to \"The Raven\").</li>\n<li>Familiars cannot interact with the environment except to examine and attack. Notably, unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand\" title=\"Mage Hand\">Mage Hand</a>, they cannot be used to explore burrows or press buttons (though many of the buttons and levers can still be triggered if the Familiar Attacks them). Familiars can drag objects. This includes placing objects onto vents or moving objects off of traps.</li>\n<li>The incantation for standard Find Familiar variants is <b>Ex Textura</b>, Latin for <i>\"Out of the weave\"</i>, while that of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Boo\" title=\"Find Familiar: Boo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Boo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Boo\" title=\"Find Familiar: Boo\">Find Familiar: Boo</a> is <b>Invoco Te</b>, Latin for <i>\"I call you\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>Select variant:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cat\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Cat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cat\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cat\">Find Familiar: Cat</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Crab\" title=\"Find Familiar: Crab\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Crab\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Find_Familiar_Crab_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Crab\" title=\"Find Familiar: Crab\">Find Familiar: Crab</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Frog\" title=\"Find Familiar: Frog\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Frog\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Find_Familiar_Frog_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Frog\" title=\"Find Familiar: Frog\">Find Familiar: Frog</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Rat\" title=\"Find Familiar: Rat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Rat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Find_Familiar_Rat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Rat\" title=\"Find Familiar: Rat\">Find Familiar: Rat</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Raven\" title=\"Find Familiar: Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Raven\" title=\"Find Familiar: Raven\">Find Familiar: Raven</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Spider\" title=\"Find Familiar: Spider\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Find_Familiar_Spider_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Spider\" title=\"Find Familiar: Spider\">Find Familiar: Spider</a></li></ul>\n<p>Variants exclusive to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Chain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\">Pact of the Chain</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Imp\" title=\"Find Familiar: Imp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Imp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Imp\" title=\"Find Familiar: Imp\">Find Familiar: Imp</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Quasit\">Find Familiar: Quasit</a></li></ul>\n<p>Special separate variants of this spell that can only summon one specific creature:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Boo\" title=\"Find Familiar: Boo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Boo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Find_Familiar_Boo_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Boo\" title=\"Find Familiar: Boo\">Find Familiar: Boo</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a> only)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Find_Familiar_Quasit_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Cheeky_Quasit\" title=\"Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit\">Find Familiar: Cheeky Quasit</a> (Obtainable in the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a>}</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/60px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/80px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Find_Familiar_Scratch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Scratch\" title=\"Find Familiar: Scratch\">Find Familiar: Scratch</a> (If <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch\" title=\"Scratch\">Scratch</a> is in the <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Followers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp Followers\">camp</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Scratch%27s_Ball\" title=\"Scratch's Ball\">Scratch's Ball</a> is in possession)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\">